OL,3,ASinn Fein will co-operate with PSNI
OL,4,Ainvestigation over Drumcree protest,
OL,5,Asays McDonald
OL,6,
OL,7,FMary Lou McDonald has said that
OL,8,F"there's no question with us
OL,9,Fco-operating with any process that will
OL,10,Funfold".
OL,12,FSpeaking on Sunday, Portadown District
OL,13,FMaster Nigel Dawson said police
OL,14,Fconfirmed to them that Saturday's
OL,15,Fgathering on the Garvaghy Road was
OL,16,F"unnotified" and police were "taking
OL,17,Fevidence".
